        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Satin Stainless Steel Oval Doorbell Button</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nA nicely designed stainless steel doorbell with a simple oval plate from <a href=\"/collections/ahi\"><b>AHI Hardware</b></a>. You can mount this oval bell button horizontal or vertical. Packaged as a kit with an electrical bell button and installation hardware. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p align=\"center\">\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/AHI-SIG762_size.gif?v=1704354542\" width\"305\" height=\"316\" border=\"0\" alt=\"AHI SIG762 Oval Doorbell Button Specifications\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Please Note</b> This is a replacement trim only. It comes packaged with button, rosette, and installation screws. It DOES NOT include the chime.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for AHI SIG762 Doorbell Button\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: 304 Stainless Steel</li>\r\n<li>Finish <b>Satin Stainless Steel</b></li>\r\n<li>Length: 5-1/2\" (140 mm)</li>\r\n<li>Width: 1-9/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Plate Thickness: .116\" (3 mm)</li>\r\n<li>Includes Bell Button</li>\r\n<li>Packaged with mounting hardware.</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/SIG762.pdf?v=1691093353\" target=\"new\"><b>AHI SIG762 Dimensions (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
